Tatakbo ka?

5
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:22,689
Oo, ikaw?

6
00:00:22,772 --> 00:00:24,482
Ah, may practice ako ngayon.

7
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:28,361
May pa-tryouts kasi 'yong papa ni Blake.
Kailangan ko 'yong sponsorship nila.

8
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:31,448
-Kayang-kaya mo 'yan.
-May sasabihin ako sa 'yo.

9
00:00:31,948 --> 00:00:35,910
-Ngayong nakapasa na 'ko sa driver's test…
-Wag mo na 'ko yabangan.

10
00:00:35,994 --> 00:00:38,663
Ba't ba kinakabahan ka? Makakapasa ka.

11
00:00:39,456 --> 00:00:40,540
Okay, salamat.

12
00:00:41,374 --> 00:00:43,626
Gusto kong mag-date tayo.

13
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:46,046
Sige, pwede naman.

14
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:50,216
-Dapat 'yong walang makakakita sa 'tin.
-Mag-movie date kaya tayo sa Lockwood?

15
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,219
-Horror 'yong showing sa Mirror Ball.
-Ayos 'yon.

16
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,555
Sasabihin ko na lang, may party kami.

17
00:00:55,638 --> 00:00:58,683
Ako naman, ipapaalam kong
pupunta ako kina Grace.

18
00:01:03,229 --> 00:01:04,064
Uy.

19
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:05,523
-Uy.
-Uy.

20
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,318
Ano'ng ginagawa n'yo?

21
00:01:09,569 --> 00:01:11,571
-Wala.
-May practice ako ngayon.

22
00:01:14,949 --> 00:01:19,120
So parallel parking
'yong huling part ng driver's test?

23
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:22,373
Oo, pagkatapos mong mag-drive.

24
00:01:24,667 --> 00:01:26,252
-Gets.
-Okay.

25
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:29,214
-Kaya mo 'yan.
-Sana nga.

26
00:01:31,382 --> 00:01:33,218
Okay, bye sa inyo.

27
00:01:33,301 --> 00:01:34,177
Bye.

28
00:01:53,071 --> 00:01:53,988
Ang ganda dito.

29
00:02:01,204 --> 00:02:03,540
Ano'ng ginagawa natin dito, Pa?

30
00:02:04,541 --> 00:02:05,583
Nakikita mo 'to?

31
00:02:06,793 --> 00:02:07,877
Loam soil 'to.

32
00:02:08,753 --> 00:02:10,713
Mabuti ba 'yon?

33
00:02:11,297 --> 00:02:13,341
Oo, sa pagtatanim ng grapes.

34
00:02:13,424 --> 00:02:14,384
Grapes?

35
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:17,971
-Ano'ng meron?
-Okay.

36
00:02:18,054 --> 00:02:23,226
So no'ng Prohibition days, gumagawa
ng wine 'yong lolo ng lolo ng papa mo.

37
00:02:23,309 --> 00:02:26,271
May kutob na kami, pero di namin alam
kung saan magtatanim no'n.

38
00:02:26,354 --> 00:02:28,731
Well, hanggang sa nakita ko
'tong grape vine

39
00:02:28,815 --> 00:02:30,817
no'ng hinahanap ko si Murphy.

40
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:33,194
Nabuhay 'tong grape vine na 'to dito.

41
00:02:33,695 --> 00:02:37,198
Eto na 'yong sagot
sa financial problem natin, Will.

42
00:02:38,867 --> 00:02:41,327
Di ba, 'yong guest ranch 'yon?

43
00:02:41,911 --> 00:02:45,331
Akala ko kasi magtatayo lang tayo
ng tents at magpapa-horseback riding,

44
00:02:45,415 --> 00:02:49,085
tapos biglang may bonggang lodge
na sa harap ng bahay.

45
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:52,172
Si Richard na 'yong nasunod do'n.

46
00:02:52,255 --> 00:02:55,091
Kakausapin ko siya,
babalik tayo sa original na plano.

47
00:02:55,175 --> 00:02:56,593
Huli na para do'n, Will.

48
00:02:57,302 --> 00:02:59,304
-Magba-backout na 'ko.
-Di pwede 'yon.

49
00:02:59,387 --> 00:03:02,056
Nakabayad na tayo sa permits.
May utility lines na din.

50
00:03:02,557 --> 00:03:05,476
-May kontrata tayo.
-Kakausapin ko si Richard tungkol do'n.

51
00:03:06,978 --> 00:03:08,897
So magwa-winery na lang kayo?

52
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:14,402
Mahirap mag-start ng winery.
Matagal 'yong aabutin bago kayo kumita.

53
00:03:14,485 --> 00:03:15,820
Alam namin 'yon.

54
00:03:17,238 --> 00:03:19,991
Kaya ipapa-lease namin 'tong lupa
sa Little Cap Winery.

55
00:03:20,783 --> 00:03:24,037
Mas mabilis 'yong kikitain
kaya makakabayad agad tayo sa investors.

56
00:03:28,082 --> 00:03:30,251
'Yon na 'yong plano n'yo?

57
00:03:31,002 --> 00:03:32,754
Alam kong biglaan 'to,

58
00:03:33,922 --> 00:03:36,758
pero makakabuti 'to para sa 'ting lahat.

59
00:03:50,647 --> 00:03:53,316
Ano'ng plano mo para sa Araw ng mga Patay?

60
00:03:53,399 --> 00:03:56,110
Alam kong ayaw mong
mag-celebrate last year,

61
00:03:56,194 --> 00:03:58,905
pero naisip kong
i-celebrate natin 'yon bukas

62
00:03:58,988 --> 00:04:00,782
bago ako bumalik sa New York.

63
00:04:01,741 --> 00:04:03,493
Babalik ka sa New York?

64
00:04:03,576 --> 00:04:06,663
Oo, may meetings ako para sa rantso.

65
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:10,833
Nagkaproblema ba kayo sa rantso
dahil sa nangyari sa barn?

66
00:04:12,126 --> 00:04:16,714
Well, di maiiwasan 'yong aberya
pero maaayos din 'yon.

67
00:04:16,798 --> 00:04:18,716
-Talaga?
-Oo.

68
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,718
Wag kang mag-alala, okay?

69
00:04:21,886 --> 00:04:22,720
Okay.

70
00:04:24,305 --> 00:04:26,557
So ano'ng plano bukas?

71
00:04:29,644 --> 00:04:30,520
Ewan ko.

72
00:04:31,145 --> 00:04:33,940
Ikaw ang bahala.
Pwede naman next year na lang.

73
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,275
Sige.

74
00:04:44,284 --> 00:04:45,618
Naawa ako kay Will.

75
00:04:46,828 --> 00:04:48,246
Nag-effort talaga siya.

76
00:04:48,746 --> 00:04:50,873
Palipasin lang natin 'to,
kakausapin ko siya.

77
00:04:50,957 --> 00:04:53,334
Di din matutuwa si Richard
sa ibabalita natin.

78
00:04:53,418 --> 00:04:55,336
Well, di ko na problema 'yon.

79
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:56,921
Alam ko…

80
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:02,260
-Gusto niya 'tong sabihin sa 'yo.
-Naku po. Ano 'yon?

81
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:05,263
Namomroblema din siya sa pera.

82
00:05:05,972 --> 00:05:09,434
-Pera niya 'yong ginamit niya do'n.
-Di ba, may investors siya?

83
00:05:10,268 --> 00:05:11,311
Ba't niya ginawa 'yon?

84
00:05:12,687 --> 00:05:15,064
Para kay Jackie,
siya na lang 'yong pamilya niya.

85
00:05:25,825 --> 00:05:30,663
So may sampung volunteers na
para sa community garden clean up.

86
00:05:31,622 --> 00:05:34,125
Tapos na 'yong meeting natin.

87
00:05:34,208 --> 00:05:38,129
Pinapadikit ni Principal Whitmore
'tong posters sa buong school.

88
00:05:38,212 --> 00:05:42,967
Kumuha kayo ng isa
at i-post n'yo 'to paglabas n'yo.

89
00:05:43,843 --> 00:05:47,555
Nakita ko na 'to.
Eto 'yong Silver Falls Sparkle.

90
00:05:47,638 --> 00:05:51,392
Oo, masaya 'yan. May twinky lights
decorations 'yong buong bayan.

91
00:05:51,476 --> 00:05:54,354
May food trucks, palaro, at music.
May hot chocolate din.

92
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:57,440
-Nagpapa-charity raffle 'yong church.
-May awards ceremony din

93
00:05:57,523 --> 00:06:01,694
para sa mga taong gumawa
ng special na bagay dito sa 'tin.

94
00:06:01,778 --> 00:06:03,946
Sobrang Silver Falls vibe no'n.

95
00:06:05,198 --> 00:06:09,911
-Ayos. Ano'ng pwede nating itulong?
-Wala. May town committe na para do'n.

96
00:06:10,787 --> 00:06:14,832
Okay. Next week na lang, guys.
Happy Halloween sa inyo.

97
00:06:14,916 --> 00:06:15,750
Okay.

98
00:06:16,834 --> 00:06:17,668
Salamat, Erin.

99
00:06:19,212 --> 00:06:20,922
May naisip akong pwedeng puntahan.

100
00:06:21,005 --> 00:06:23,466
May bahay sa Rogers Street
na ginagawang haunted house.

101
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:27,011
Di ako pinapayagang pumunta do'n
pero mukhang di naman nakakatakot, eh.

102
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:29,347
Punta tayo do'n, masaya 'yon.

103
00:06:30,139 --> 00:06:32,558
Actually, may date kami ni Alex.

104
00:06:34,727 --> 00:06:37,522
Idadahilan ko ngang magkasama tayo, eh.

105
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:42,110
Sige. Gusto ko talagang maging palusot mo
para sa secret date mo.

106
00:06:43,194 --> 00:06:45,822
-Salamat.
-Saan kayo magdi-date?

107
00:06:45,905 --> 00:06:48,491
Okay. Ano'ng plano natin sa Halloween?

108
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:52,829
Wala. Magre-review ako
para sa math test natin next week.

109
00:06:52,912 --> 00:06:58,042
Nagalit si Papa kasi bumagsak ako do'n.
So magre-review kami ni Jackie sa bahay.

110
00:06:58,126 --> 00:06:58,960
Di ba, Jackie?

111
00:06:59,043 --> 00:07:00,044
Ay, oo.

112
00:07:00,128 --> 00:07:02,880
Bet kong magpa-Hallowen party mamaya.

113
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:06,717
Magpapa-party ka talaga
pagkatapos ng nangyari sa inyo ni Nathan?

114
00:07:06,801 --> 00:07:09,554
Well, gusto kong magpa-party
para gumaan 'yong pakiramdam ko.

115
00:07:09,637 --> 00:07:12,515
Eh, magha-Halloween na mamaya.

116
00:07:12,598 --> 00:07:16,227
Kulang 'yong oras mo
para mag-set ng party.

117
00:07:16,727 --> 00:07:20,523
Di naman kailangang bongga.
May alam akong place sa taas ng Monty's.

118
00:07:20,606 --> 00:07:23,151
Medyo creepy do'n pero pwede na din.

119
00:07:23,234 --> 00:07:27,196
Grace, ayain mo 'yong schoolmates natin
bago mag-uwian.

120
00:07:28,156 --> 00:07:29,198
Oh, sige.

121
00:07:30,408 --> 00:07:33,578
Pa'no naman 'yong pagkain at decorations?

122
00:07:33,661 --> 00:07:35,955
Please, Jackie.

123
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:39,041
Kailangan ko 'to,
para di ko na maisip si Nathan.

124
00:07:41,210 --> 00:07:42,044
Okay.

125
00:07:42,128 --> 00:07:43,212
-Yehey!
-Tutulong ako.

126
00:07:44,172 --> 00:07:46,841
Alex, gusto mong sumama
sa Halloween party?

127
00:07:48,634 --> 00:07:50,636
-Mamayang gabi?
-Oo, Halloween mamaya, eh.

128
00:07:51,554 --> 00:07:54,891
Di pwede. Sasamahan namin 'yong mga batang
mag-trick-or-treat. Di ba?

129
00:07:54,974 --> 00:07:58,060
Akala ko ba, magre-review kayo ni Grace?

130
00:08:00,855 --> 00:08:04,192
Oo, pagkatapos namin samahan
'yong mga bata.

131
00:08:04,275 --> 00:08:06,486
Sumama ka na lang sa party.

132
00:08:13,534 --> 00:08:16,078
Oh, sige. Kitakits na lang.

133
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:17,246
Happy Halloween!

134
00:08:18,247 --> 00:08:20,208
-Mamaya na lang, okay?
-Okay.

135
00:08:22,835 --> 00:08:26,297
-Ano'ng meron do'n?
-Magpapa-Halloween party si Skylar.

136
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,133
Sure akong di ako kasama do'n.

137
00:08:29,634 --> 00:08:32,845
-Sa bahay na lang tayo.
-Di pa rin kayo nag-uusap ni Erin?

138
00:08:33,638 --> 00:08:37,558
-Ayaw niya akong makausap.
-Okay, magmu-movie marathon kami.

139
00:08:45,316 --> 00:08:48,402
Guys! Makinig kayo!

140
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:54,534
Nag-high school din ako.

141
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:59,705
So nage-gets ko pag may nag-aaya
sa inyong mag-drugs o mag-inom.

142
00:09:00,206 --> 00:09:03,626
Pero bilang student athletes,
dapat mas disiplinado tayo,

143
00:09:04,126 --> 00:09:06,462
pero may ilan sa inyong di nagawa 'yon.

144
00:09:11,801 --> 00:09:15,471
Nag-positive sa drugs
'yong mga pangalang babanggitin ko,

145
00:09:15,555 --> 00:09:18,558
masususpinde sila sa team
until futher notice.

146
00:09:18,641 --> 00:09:19,559
Seryoso?

147
00:09:19,642 --> 00:09:23,354
Sina Carter Reeves, Sean Stanley,
at si Dylan Newsome.

148
00:09:24,772 --> 00:09:25,606
Isaac.

149
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,236
-Ikaw ang bagong quarterback.
-Ano 'ka mo?

150
00:09:41,247 --> 00:09:44,250
-Dylan, sandali lang.
-Ano'ng kailangan mo?

151
00:09:45,793 --> 00:09:47,587
-Ayos ka lang?
-Siyempre, hindi.

152
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:50,047
Bangko ako dahil sa 'yo.
Di tayo aabot sa playoffs.

153
00:09:50,131 --> 00:09:54,176
-Di ko kasalanang nag-positive ka sa test.
-Nakuha mo na 'yong gusto mo.

154
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:57,513
Quarterback na 'yong pinsan mo,
di ka na maiinggit kasi di ako lalaro.

155
00:09:57,597 --> 00:10:00,933
Seryoso ka ba?
Lagi nga kitang tinutulungan, eh.

156
00:10:01,434 --> 00:10:05,146
Tulong? Muntik na akong ma-injured
dahil pine-pressure mo 'ko.

157
00:10:05,229 --> 00:10:08,816
Para mas gumaling ka at manalo tayo,
gano'n ang coach.

158
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:13,237
Alam mo 'yong dapat mong ginawa?
Dapat ikaw 'yong nagpa-drug test,

159
00:10:13,321 --> 00:10:16,157
pero di mo 'yon ginawa
kasi gusto mo 'kong isabotahe.

160
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,283
'Yon 'yong tingin mo?

161
00:10:18,492 --> 00:10:22,079
Nagsisimula pa lang tayo.
Ba't ko naman gagawin 'yon?

162
00:10:22,163 --> 00:10:23,664
Wala namang makakaalam no'n.

163
00:10:26,626 --> 00:10:29,003
Sinisisi mo na lang lagi sa iba, 'no.

164
00:10:30,463 --> 00:10:34,759
Anong sinasabotahe?
Ginagawa mo na nga 'yon sa sarili mo, eh.

165
00:10:38,929 --> 00:10:39,805
Okay.

166
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:44,852
Dapat mo bang bilisan o bagalan
pag mag-e-exit ka sa freeway ramp?

167
00:10:44,935 --> 00:10:46,354
-Babagalan.
-Tama.

168
00:10:47,188 --> 00:10:50,441
Ano'ng gagawin mo
pag may nakaharang sa tawiran?

169
00:10:50,524 --> 00:10:55,321
Dahan-dahan akong aandar at lilingon
sa lanes bago ako pumasok ng intersection.

170
00:10:55,404 --> 00:10:56,405
Ayos.

171
00:10:57,698 --> 00:11:00,951
May tickets na 'ko
para sa movie date natin.

172
00:11:01,702 --> 00:11:02,536
Ayos.

173
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:06,248
Makiki-party lang muna tayo kina Skylar.

174
00:11:06,332 --> 00:11:09,502
Pupunta ako do'n nang maaga
tapos magkasunod tayong aalis do'n

175
00:11:09,585 --> 00:11:10,711
-para di halata.
-Sige.

176
00:11:13,130 --> 00:11:17,218
Dadating 'yong time na magkasama tayong
pupunta sa parties.

177
00:11:17,301 --> 00:11:18,886
Alam ko naman.

178
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:23,891
Naisip ko lang, sa dami ng nangyari,

179
00:11:23,974 --> 00:11:27,269
parang ayoko munang sabihin sa iba
'yong tungkol sa 'tin.

180
00:11:27,353 --> 00:11:28,437
Oo, tama.

181
00:11:33,526 --> 00:11:34,402
Naku, hindi.

182
00:11:37,113 --> 00:11:38,030
Bakit?

183
00:11:40,908 --> 00:11:41,742
Ano kasi…

184
00:11:43,619 --> 00:11:45,287
Paubos na 'to.

185
00:11:46,455 --> 00:11:48,499
Bumili ka na lang ng bago.

186
00:11:48,582 --> 00:11:50,918
Di 'yon 'yong point ko.

187
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:56,424
Galing kasi 'to sa mama ko.

188
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:03,556
-Sorry…
-Ayos lang. Pabango lang naman 'to.

189
00:12:05,725 --> 00:12:07,560
Okay lang 'yon.

190
00:12:11,021 --> 00:12:12,314
Aalis na 'ko.

191
00:12:12,398 --> 00:12:15,025
Okay. Kaya mo 'yan.

192
00:12:15,693 --> 00:12:16,610
Salamat.

193
00:12:22,700 --> 00:12:25,661
Pa'no naging second string si Garcia?

194
00:12:25,745 --> 00:12:28,539
-Lagi siyang nag-o-overthrow sa 'kin.
-Uy, Cole.

195
00:12:30,708 --> 00:12:34,420
Alam kong pinsan mo siya,
pero di siya marunong bumato.

196
00:12:34,503 --> 00:12:37,715
Okay. Magagaling na kasi kayo
no'ng rookie pa lang kayo, 'no?

197
00:12:40,843 --> 00:12:42,052
Tigilan n'yo na siya.

198
00:12:44,430 --> 00:12:45,639
Tigilan na natin siya.

199
00:12:46,432 --> 00:12:47,349
Ready ka na?

200
00:12:47,933 --> 00:12:48,934
Ready na.

201
00:12:51,145 --> 00:12:54,899
Nire-represent ng orange cones
'yong mga katabi mong sasakyan sa parking.

202
00:12:54,982 --> 00:12:58,569
Mag-ingat ka sa pag-atras mo.

203
00:12:58,652 --> 00:12:59,737
Okay.

204
00:13:00,321 --> 00:13:04,700
Pag lagpas mo sa huling cone,
um-exit ka sa kanan mo.

205
00:13:09,330 --> 00:13:13,250
Sorry, ang lakas ng preno nito.
Nasanay ako sa ibang preno.

206
00:13:22,968 --> 00:13:26,347
-Ilagay mo sa park mode 'yong kotse.
-Pwede ko bang ulitin?

207
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:28,140
May nabangga kang dalawang cones.

208
00:13:28,224 --> 00:13:30,559
-Pero…
-Bagsak ka.

209
00:13:35,856 --> 00:13:38,108
Sasamahan ko 'yong mga batang
mag-trick-or-treat,

210
00:13:38,192 --> 00:13:41,737
iabot n'yo 'to
sa mga magti-trick-or-treat.

211
00:13:42,321 --> 00:13:45,199
Para saan? Wala namang
nagti-trick-or-treat dito.

212
00:13:45,282 --> 00:13:48,536
-Malay mo, meron na ngayon.
-Pwede kaming mag-pizza?

213
00:13:51,497 --> 00:13:53,332
-Sige.
-Ayos!

214
00:13:56,293 --> 00:13:57,670
Nakabalik na kayo.

215
00:14:01,924 --> 00:14:04,718
-Bumagsak ako.
-Aw, sorry.

216
00:14:05,302 --> 00:14:08,097
Ayos lang 'yon.
Siya nga, tatlong beses bumagsak, eh.

217
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:12,309
Nagkasakit kasi ako
